=2 Walkthrough
If you had just completed the previous quest, you must zone first before you can get this quest.
* Speak to {n:Ohbiru-Dohbiru} for a cutscene. You will receive a {@k} {k:Rhinostery certificate}.
** The {@k} {k:Rhinostery certificate} provides access to {z:Toraimarai Canal} through {z:Windurst Walls} (H-3).
* Trade {n:Ohbiru-Dohbiru} 3 {i:Starmite Shells|Starmite Shell|906} to complete this quest.
** {i:Starmite Shells|Starmite Shell|906} drop off {m:Starmites|Starmite} in {z:Toraimarai Canal}.
** To find {m:Starmites|Starmite}, enter {z:Toraimarai Canal} by speaking to {n:Seven of Diamonds} {z:Windurst Walls} (H-3).
*** Head east at the first intersection.
*** At (I-8) go down the stairs, then head east.
*** Turn right at the two intersections at (I-10).
*** Go up the stairs at (I-9).
*** Head west to (G-9) to find where the {m:Starmites|Starmite} spawn.

Once you have 3, you can return to {n:Ohbiru-Dohbiru} and trade him the shells to complete the quest.
